{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grow and Crossbreed Your Own Vegetables.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raise crops while experimenting with soil and compost,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and create brand-new varieties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What kind of vegetables will you grow? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609130/extras/\u8fb2\u696d.jpg?t=1744085434\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Test Your Skills in the Vegetable Contest.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete with rivals and aim for victory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">with vegetables that match the theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609130/extras/\u30b3\u30f3\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8.jpg?t=1744085434\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Direct Sales or Wholesale\u2014How Will You Sell?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put in the effort to earn higher prices,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">or ship in bulk for efficiency?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s all about your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609130/extras/\u76f4\u8ca9.jpg?t=1744085434\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow your own carefully cultivated vegetables</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and create special varieties that are uniquely yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609130/extras/\u91ce\u83dc.png?t=1744085434\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609130?t=1744085434","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609130/0d94877900c5fb06f8bbe4c8eacd953cf43f1bc6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744085434","c